<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Sep 27 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 9300, tin up 290, lead up 1475, zinc down 800, aluminium up 4050, nickel up 624, aluminium alloy down 660</p>
</text>
